    GET_PGM_PROCESSOR_INFO since SP4b, PROGRAM_NEXT since SP4b Task 4, GET_SECTOR_INFO,
    PROGRAM_FORMAT and PROGRAM_VERIFY in SP4c. No PGM row routes to Xcp_CmdNotImplemented any more,
    so an enabled PGM row and a disabled one are no longer interchangeable for any of them: a disabled
    row answers ERR_CMD_UNKNOWN and an enabled one runs a handler. Three of the eleven
