{#- PGM_PROPERTIES (SP4c Task 3, design doc DD89): mirrors pagProperties' own conditional-OR shape
    immediately below, one term per configured capability. Bit 0 (ABSOLUTE_MODE) is unconditional --
    every build this module ever generates offers absolute access -- and bit 1 (FUNCTIONAL_MODE) has
    no term here at all: it is a later task's own addition (design doc DD92, driven by the two
    functional callbacks' own configuration), and this shape -- ORing one more shifted term into the
    same expression -- is exactly what lets that task add it without rewriting anything above. Read
    back at Xcp_Ptr->general->pgmProperties by both Xcp_DTOCmdPgmGetPgmProcessorInfo (which reports
    it) and Xcp_DTOCmdPgmProgramFormat (which checks it before accepting a non-default request
